7,Sámi musihkka - Music in Sami languages - Rate Your Music,https://rateyourmusic.com/list/kyvetti/sami_musihkka___music_in_sami_languages/,"Sep 29, 2025 · Most common traditional musical style of Sami is Joik (Yoik, Juoiggus, Juoigan, Luohti). It is a singing style reflecting specific people or places, traditionally sung a cappella or accompanied by drum, though several modern singers perform with a wide variety of instruments and fusion styles.","Saami, Akkala",Uralic
8,The rebirth of the joik | Sami culture | Music and traditions,https://www.visitnorway.com/typically-norwegian/sami-people/rebirth-of-the-joik/,"Young Sami performers are breathing new life to one of Europe’s oldest song traditions. Ancient sounds meet modern genres, ushering in a new wave of internationally acclaimed musicians including Elle Márjá Eira and Marja Mortensson.","Saami, Akkala",Uralic
